The '''Freezing Hydra Island''' is an event at the [[Hydra Island]].

==Usage==
The Freezing Hydra Island event is required in order to gain access to the [[Dojo Vault]], and ultimately the [[Draco]] race's [[Race Awakening]]. The player is able to light up the {{Color|green|green}} and <span class="Outline-B">{{Color|yellow|yellow}}</span> lanterns in front of the vault during this event, hence unlocking said vault. 

Note: The lanterns can only be lit up by the player if the [[Dojo Vault#Lanterns|requirements]] for them to be lit up are met by said player.

==Obtainment==
The player must unlock [[Draco]] V3 and set sail to hunt the [[Leviathan]] with the [[Beast Hunter]] boat. After defeating it, they have to harpoon the [[Leviathan Heart]] dropped by the boss and bring it all the way to the waterfall of the [[Hydra Island]]. After doing so, the Freezing Hydra Island will initiate and the player can perform the steps needed to unlock the vault. It's important to note that the player is only able to interact with the event if they were part of the [[Sea Exploration Group]] bringing the heart to the island, and hasn't died since the heart was obtained. 

Note: This event only lasts for about 5-15 minutes. After freezing the [[Hydra Island]], the [[Leviathan Heart]] will disappear.

