==Notes==
* The player can be any race while fighting the [[Leviathan]], however they must swap back to [[Draco]] (after the island is frozen) in order to ignite the dojo lanterns and open the [[Dojo Vault]].

==Trivia==
* Interestingly, during this, the [[Dragon Dojo|dojo]] lanterns gain a proximity prompt that is not normally visible until this, and disappears after it ends.
* The water around Freezing Hydra Island will not change and will still act as water, not ice.
* While the island is frozen, enemies will be covered in ice (this affects Elite enemies as well), and while in this state, they cannot move towards the player, but they can still attack them. Breaking the ice will deal around 1/2 of their [[health]] and free them from their restraint.
** This makes doing quests that require NPCs quite easy, as they take less time to kill and makes grinding for [[Dragon Scale]]s and [[Blaze Ember]]s quicker.
*** This should not be relied on, as the snowstorm only lasts for around 5-15 minutes and requires a [[Leviathan Heart]] to do so.
* The music theme is also used in the [[Beautiful Pirate Domain|Beautiful Pirate's Domain]].